{"schemaVersion":1,"id":8,"sections":[{"id":"107007-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[210],"start":0,"count":5},{"id":"107007-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10200],"start":5,"count":1},{"id":"107008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[220,221,222,223],"start":6,"count":44},{"id":"107008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10210],"start":50,"count":6},{"id":"107009-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[230],"start":56,"count":6},{"id":"107009-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10220],"start":62,"count":12}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107007-PROLOGUE:210:2","scriptId":210,"text":"齐格菲防线错综复杂的地形，导致行进速度并不理想。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107007-PROLOGUE:210:3","scriptId":210,"text":"当然，还有一个原因是猎虎小队……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107007-PROLOGUE:210:4","scriptId":210,"text":"“前方发现敌人，我已经将它们引至火炮打击范围，大家准备进攻！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":81,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107007-PROLOGUE:210:5","scriptId":210,"text":"“没问题，开始火力铺设。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":81,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107007-PROLOGUE:210:6","scriptId":210,"text":"（每次侦察都能引一堆战车兽回来，没完没了啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107007-EPILOGUE:10200:1","scriptId":10200,"text":"（这样打下去可不行。我得想想办法。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:2","scriptId":220,"text":"继续向研究所方向进军中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:3","scriptId":220,"text":"齐格菲防线果然名不虚传，敌人的炮火阵地部署得太密集，看来要想办法偷渡过去……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:4","scriptId":220,"text":"(在齐格菲防线打拉锯战，简直是自寻死路。)","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:5","scriptId":220,"text":"“敌人的火炮能从远处打击我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:6","scriptId":220,"text":"“我们也能还以颜色，怕什么！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:7","scriptId":220,"text":"“此行的目的是探查被占领的研究所，最好不要消耗过多的战力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:8","scriptId":220,"text":"“在掩体有限的情况下，还是采用声东击西的战术拉扯敌方火力散布才是上策。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:9","scriptId":220,"text":"“好吧，莱尼、拉伊莎和普莉玛留下，在这里和敌人进行炮击战，我们从旁边的小路绕过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:10","scriptId":220,"text":"“嗯……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":92,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:11","scriptId":220,"text":"“好嘞～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":71,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:220:12","scriptId":220,"text":"“保证完成任务！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":61,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:2","scriptId":221,"text":"继续向研究所方向进军中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":61,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:3","scriptId":221,"text":"齐格菲防线果然名不虚传，敌人的炮火阵地部署得太密集，看来要想办法偷渡过去……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":61,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:4","scriptId":221,"text":"(在齐格菲防线打拉锯战，简直是自寻死路。)","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:5","scriptId":221,"text":"“敌人的火炮能从远处打击我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:6","scriptId":221,"text":"“我们也能还以颜色，怕什么！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:7","scriptId":221,"text":"“此行的目的是探查被占领的研究所，最好不要消耗过多的战力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:8","scriptId":221,"text":"“在掩体有限的情况下，还是采用声东击西的战术拉扯敌方火力散布才是上策。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:9","scriptId":221,"text":"“好吧，卓娅、拉伊莎和普莉玛留下，在这里和敌人进行炮击战，我们从旁边的小路绕过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:10","scriptId":221,"text":"“嗯……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":92,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:11","scriptId":221,"text":"“好嘞～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":71,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:221:12","scriptId":221,"text":"“只要吸引敌人就行了吧，这很容易。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1171,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:2","scriptId":222,"text":"继续向研究所方向进军中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1171,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:3","scriptId":222,"text":"齐格菲防线果然名不虚传，敌人的炮火阵地部署得太密集，看来要想办法偷渡过去……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1171,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:4","scriptId":222,"text":"(在齐格菲防线打拉锯战，简直是自寻死路。)","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:5","scriptId":222,"text":"“敌人的火炮能从远处打击我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:6","scriptId":222,"text":"“我们也能还以颜色，怕什么！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:7","scriptId":222,"text":"“此行的目的是探查被占领的研究所，最好不要消耗过多的战力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:8","scriptId":222,"text":"“在掩体有限的情况下，还是采用声东击西的战术拉扯敌方火力散布才是上策。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:9","scriptId":222,"text":"“好吧，索菲、嘉丝莉和普莉玛留下，在这里和敌人进行炮击战，我们从旁边的小路绕过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:10","scriptId":222,"text":"“嗯……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":92,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:11","scriptId":222,"text":"“只要牵制敌人就行了是吧，这个我在行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":968,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:222:12","scriptId":222,"text":"“我会努力的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1146,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:2","scriptId":223,"text":"继续向研究所方向进军中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1146,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:3","scriptId":223,"text":"齐格菲防线果然名不虚传，敌人的炮火阵地部署得太密集，看来要想办法偷渡过去……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1146,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:4","scriptId":223,"text":"(在齐格菲防线打拉锯战，简直是自寻死路。)","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:5","scriptId":223,"text":"“敌人的火炮能从远处打击我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:6","scriptId":223,"text":"“我们也能还以颜色，怕什么！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:7","scriptId":223,"text":"“此行的目的是探查被占领的研究所，最好不要消耗过多的战力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:8","scriptId":223,"text":"“在掩体有限的情况下，还是采用声东击西的战术拉扯敌方火力散布才是上策。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:9","scriptId":223,"text":"“好吧，陈雯兰、夏虹萤和普莉玛留下，在这里和敌人进行炮击战，我们从旁边的小路绕过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:10","scriptId":223,"text":"“嗯……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":92,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:11","scriptId":223,"text":"“我会尽量拖住它们的主力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1158,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-PROLOGUE:223:12","scriptId":223,"text":"“其实这里多歼灭一些敌人也不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":1170,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-EPILOGUE:10210:1","scriptId":10210,"text":"“好累……不过终于绕过了火力包围。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-EPILOGUE:10210:2","scriptId":10210,"text":"“研究所就在眼前！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-EPILOGUE:10210:3","scriptId":10210,"text":"“我和小飞象去探探路。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":81,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-EPILOGUE:10210:4","scriptId":10210,"text":"“给我等等……你太容易暴露目标了。”这次我一把拉住佐伊，没让她冲出去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-EPILOGUE:10210:5","scriptId":10210,"text":"“那个，莉娜已经去了，我只是想赶上她。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107008-EPILOGUE:10210:6","scriptId":10210,"text":"“我的天……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107009-PROLOGUE:230:2","scriptId":230,"text":"好不容易赶上了莉娜，但是她已经和研究所内的猩猩们开始了战斗……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-PROLOGUE:230:3","scriptId":230,"text":"“又是二话不说开打了么……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-PROLOGUE:230:4","scriptId":230,"text":"“你还不是一样么……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107009-PROLOGUE:230:5","scriptId":230,"text":"突然，对面的战车兽开口说话了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":52,"speaker":"苏格拉底","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107009-PROLOGUE:230:6","scriptId":230,"text":"“人类……警告……离开。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":52,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":113,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-PROLOGUE:230:7","scriptId":230,"text":"“真的有会说话的战车兽！我要捉活的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":113,"right":52,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:1","scriptId":10220,"text":"费了九牛二虎之力，终于生擒了那只会说话的战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":113,"right":52,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":52,"speaker":"苏格拉底","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:2","scriptId":10220,"text":"“人类……警告……离开！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":113,"right":52,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:3","scriptId":10220,"text":"“这家伙只会说这个？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":52,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:4","scriptId":10220,"text":"“真扫兴，灭了它吧……”奈乐显然失去了兴趣。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:5","scriptId":10220,"text":"“等等，我来问问。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:6","scriptId":10220,"text":"“你是从哪里学的说话？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:7","scriptId":10220,"text":"猩猩指了指地上的一本儿童绘本，书页已经被翻烂了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:8","scriptId":10220,"text":"“是这里的人，教你说话的？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:9","scriptId":10220,"text":"猩猩看了看我，然后说道","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":52,"speaker":"苏格拉底","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:10","scriptId":10220,"text":"“人类……朋友……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":52,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":113,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:11","scriptId":10220,"text":"“什么！？这实在是太惊人了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":113,"right":52,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":113,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107009-EPILOGUE:10220:12","scriptId":10220,"text":"“我要带它回总部确认！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":113,"right":52,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["无视警告继续向前，探查究竟总是要付出点代价的。","要想想办法，在外围打消耗战不是明智的选择。","顺利绕过敌方火炮的火力覆盖，但是好像还是被发现了，不谈了……没有比不听话的队友更棘手的麻烦了。"]}
